# Server URL the client connects to (Colyseus websocket endpoint).
# Usually leave it unset: `npm run dev` falls back to ws://localhost:2567,
# and a production build talks to whichever host served it (ws:// or wss://
# to match the page). Only set it to point the client at a different server.
# VITE_SERVER_URL=wss://trivia.example.com
